  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you gain this talent, choose one skill that you have unlocked skill leverage with. After you spend skill leverage to use change tactics with a skill check of that type, you can choose to discard the extra die in order to reroll the d20. If you do, you must keep the new d20 result, even if it is lower.</p>\n<p>You may select this talent multiple times, each time selecting an additional skill that you have unlocked skill leverage with.</p>\n<p><strong>Utility Option:</strong> This talent can be taken as a utility talent as long as the chosen skill is a background skill.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/vocation#toc14\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
